Generate a sine wave.

Arguments:
- `id` : `string?` (default `null`) — Force the value of the source ID.
- `amplitude` : `{float}` (default `1.0`) — Maximal value of the waveform.
- `duration` : `float?` (default `null`) — Duration in seconds (`null` means infinite).
- `(unlabeled)` : `{float}` (default `440.0`) — Frequency of the sine.
